 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pUjlvbdoMLAQ7kNvwE47dvq&_nc_oc=AdqiHNLFKWKH_7YwTFPnJQRTPdmV2km89En2yZ0fCV6YJomuy8lNIrO3ZZ0rKSDLIx8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPTaTjmfRBc3TaV4EjM9WsaTwDQTXFItr6g5YOAPYImNA&oe=6ADCCC41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=VZXIvd_w8isQ7kNvwFQFPse&_nc_oc=Adqxhqbh8_JRwGN97KjgwL4V8X03V6j8-IpD7n_Uv8Rti1JOijcC9eXMJ-_SSoRSAT0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQOYXzYaFWX4skhEYvuyavfHMg5fnQ-u1TB0d72kYE8_Bg&oe=6ADCD9A6"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=i65dV7rTJwYQ7kNvwGfds09&_nc_oc=AdrfO_E6fEyMhQzPdctehEBBRYK48OSwWFvUG2UrXeIjNSPh96LJRULht_Uuocnta5A&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQN48DNxBg_pew5_lDmgMIG47jQtTA3zPjbtv98O5P3c3g&oe=6ADCAB5C"}, {"fil